  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And you are the illustrious Scion of Bartleby. Oh, yes, I've heard of you. We get around you know, flying from skyway to skyway.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's how we lived since our original home world was scoured by the Kroks some, oh, ten or so Souliks ago. No Scion came to save us by the by.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Eh, I'm not blaming you. What would be the point? You weren't even born yet; humans live an embarrassingly scant number of centuries.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No, but that sad day begot the Baleful Flotilla. We set out to find our creators, to have them make for us a new world.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "At least that's what most of us wanted. Others learned the wrong lesson from the Kroks. They wanted blood and conquest. They became Shellions.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oof. Too old. I'm too old, Scion. Merciful Sapwe, I've not enough wind in my sails for such nonsense.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Fortunately, we have wind to spare.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BALE_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Is he talking in my head? I don't think that's polite.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He is. And he... er, I... am here to offer you our knowledge and support to uncover the mysteries of this world in exchange for resources in exploring it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BALE_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And what of my people captured by the pink woman? Like our Windstone sculptor. Can I count on the Scion to rescue them? If so, we can bargain.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_TurtleLeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_en_Sahi_Shelli_AH-BALE_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765005,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BALE-NPC09_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Splendid. Wizard, Tarrak and Ignus are, I believe, stocking a ship so we can pursue Miranda. Perhaps go see if they need a hand.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BALE_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1765141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
